{"type":"proposition","type_name":"Proposition","number":"40.2.3","title":"Empirical Bayes prediction and shrinkage","title_html":"Empirical Bayes prediction and shrinkage","html":"<p>Consider <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-gmm-random-intercept-model\">@eq-gmm-random-intercept-model</span>\nwith <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\upbeta}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛃</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\tau^{2}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em; margin-left: 0.054em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>τ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\phi\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D719 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ϕ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> known, write <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\ell_i(u)=\\sum_{j}\\log f(y_{ij}\\mid u)\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2113\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-munder space=\"4\" limits=\"false\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.285em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D457 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-munder><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D457 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2223\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mi>log</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nfor cluster <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>’s conditional\nlog-likelihood, and assume <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\ell_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2113\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nis concave in <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"u\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> — as it is for a\ncanonical link by <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-glm-concave\">@thm-glm-concave</span>, and for the gamma\nwith a log link by direct differentiation.</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p>The posterior density of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"u_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\ngiven <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{y}_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D432 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, proportional to <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\exp\\{\\ell_i(u)-u^{2}/(2\\tau^{2})\\}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c78\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c70\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2113\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em; margin-left: 0.054em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>exp</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>τ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, is\nlog-concave and its mode <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat u_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.314em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nis unique.</p></li>\n<li><p>If <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\ell_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2113\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> attains its\nmaximum at a finite <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat a_i \\ne0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.265em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2260\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>,\nthen <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat u_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.314em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> lies strictly between\n<span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat a_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.265em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>: the prediction has the same\nsign as the cluster’s own estimate and is strictly smaller in magnitude.\nIf <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\ell_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2113\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ℓ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> has no finite maximizer —\nas when every response in a binary cluster is <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"0\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> — then <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat\nu_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.314em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D462 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vert